Unit three. My Home!

2
00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:12.023
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Beginner level!

3
00:00:12.073 --> 00:00:16.334
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:16.384 --> 00:00:19.133
Today we learn: My Home. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.829 --> 00:00:23.812
Apartment. Say it with me. Apartment!

6
00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:31.268
Bedroom. Say it with me. Bedroom!

7
00:00:34.752 --> 00:00:38.352
Kitchen. Say it with me. Kitchen!

8
00:00:41.852 --> 00:00:45.535
Furniture. Say it with me. Furniture!

9
00:00:49.087 --> 00:00:53.070
Neighbor. Say it with me. Neighbor!

10
00:00:56.510 --> 00:01:00.443
Comfortable. Say it with me. Comfortable!

11
00:01:03.946 --> 00:01:07.579
Move in. Say it with me. Move in!

12
00:01:11.116 --> 00:01:14.916
Address. Say it with me. Address!

13
00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:22.420
Living room. Say it with me. Living room!

14
00:01:25.871 --> 00:01:29.204
Rent. Say it with me. Rent!

15
00:01:32.695 --> 00:01:41.770
Grammar time! There is / There are. Listen. There is a kitchen. There are two bedrooms.

16
00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:47.475
Your turn. Say it with me. There is a kitchen. There are two bedrooms.

17
00:01:52.701 --> 00:01:59.323
Our apartment has a comfortable bedroom and a small kitchen. Our neighbor helped us move in last month.

18
00:01:59.373 --> 00:02:00.782
I like this story!

19
00:02:01.926 --> 00:02:07.217
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:07.267 --> 00:02:08.417
Kitchen!

21
00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:14.919
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:14.969 --> 00:02:16.119
Move in!

23
00:02:17.117 --> 00:02:25.411
Think and answer. Describe your home in three sentences.

24
00:02:25.461 --> 00:02:26.633
Great answer!

25
00:02:27.638 --> 00:02:32.087
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
